1
00:00:00,377 --> 00:00:01,807
(Leonard:)Amy broke up with Sheldon.

2
00:00:01,878 --> 00:00:03,048
(Penny:)She did?

3
00:00:03,112 --> 00:00:05,512
(Sheldon:)Is Penny crying?

4
00:00:05,581 --> 00:00:06,581
(Leonard:)No.

5
00:00:06,615 --> 00:00:07,385
(Sheldon:)No, of course not.

6
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:10,050
(Sheldon:)They thrive on our suffering.

7
00:00:10,119 --> 00:00:11,849
Buddy, I-I'm so sorry.

8
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,850
(Leonard:)Is there anything I can do?

9
00:00:13,922 --> 00:00:15,292
(Sheldon:)Yes. If I ever talk about

10
00:00:15,357 --> 00:00:17,557
(Sheldon:)going out with a girl again,
roll your eyes at me

11
00:00:17,626 --> 00:00:20,696
(Sheldon:)like I do to you
when you say dumb things.

12
00:00:20,762 --> 00:00:22,202
Sheldon, uh, o-okay,
just because

13
00:00:22,264 --> 00:00:23,664
(Leonard:)you're going through this
with Amy

14
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:25,702
(Leonard:)doesn't mean
that all women are bad.

15
00:00:25,767 --> 00:00:28,067
(Penny:)Whatever.

16
00:00:28,136 --> 00:00:29,436
(Penny(on phone):)Hey, I just heard

17
00:00:29,504 --> 00:00:31,074
(Penny(on phone):)about you and Sheldon.
Are you okay?

18
00:00:31,139 --> 00:00:32,239
(Amy:)Not really.

19
00:00:32,307 --> 00:00:33,737
(Amy:)Can you come over?

20
00:00:33,809 --> 00:00:35,339
(Penny:)Uh, actually I'm in Vegas.

21
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:37,540
(Penny:)Leonard and I
are about to get married.

22
00:00:37,613 --> 00:00:38,843
(Amy:)Hold on.

23
00:00:38,914 --> 00:00:41,314
(Amy:)You're getting married
and you didn't invite me?

24
00:00:41,382 --> 00:00:43,952
(Penny:)Well, it was kind of
a spur-of-the-moment thing.

25
00:00:44,019 --> 00:00:45,349
(Amy:)Wow.

26
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:49,160
(Amy:)Hope I can catch
the bouquet from here.

27
00:00:49,224 --> 00:00:51,024
(Penny:)Amy, don't be like that.

28
00:00:51,093 --> 00:00:53,023
(Sheldon:)Why did I just hear Amy's name?

29
00:00:53,095 --> 00:00:54,195
(Leonard:)Penny's on the phone
with her.

30
00:00:54,262 --> 00:00:55,392
(Sheldon:)Did she say anything about me?

31
00:00:55,463 --> 00:00:56,933
(Sheldon:)Never mind. I don't care.

32
00:00:56,998 --> 00:00:58,798
(Sheldon:)Well, if you care,
you can find out and tell me.

33
00:00:58,866 --> 00:01:01,936
(Sheldon:)Just don't be shocked when
you find out that I don't care.

34
00:01:02,003 --> 00:01:03,073
(Penny:)Okay, will you relax?

35
00:01:03,138 --> 00:01:05,238
(Penny:)You're not missing
anything special.

36
00:01:06,107 --> 00:01:07,877
(Leonard:)Hey.

37
00:01:07,942 --> 00:01:08,942
(Penny:)She's upset.

38
00:01:08,976 --> 00:01:10,376
(Penny:)Look, it's gonna be
a great wedding.

39
00:01:10,445 --> 00:01:13,245
(Penny:)Look at you in
your little suit.

40
00:01:13,314 --> 00:01:15,014
(Sheldon:)Amy's upset? Is it about me?

41
00:01:15,082 --> 00:01:16,552
(Leonard:)No, I think it's because
we're eloping.

42
00:01:16,618 --> 00:01:18,848
(Sheldon:)Your marriage
is causing her pain?

43
00:01:18,919 --> 00:01:20,149
(Sheldon:)Yeah, great, I take it back.

44
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:22,660
(Sheldon:)Go ahead and do it.
Yay for love!

45
00:01:22,723 --> 00:01:26,193
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

